  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Upgrading the Agrarian Institute of Bilibiza in Cabo Delgado, Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s goal is to strengthen the agriculture sector in Cabo Delgado through the greater availability of well-trained medium level agriculture technicians and entrepreneurs. 

The intermediate outcome is that the Agrarian Institute of Bilibiza-IABil students are equipped with the skills and competencies to operate as agriculture technicians and agri-business entrepreneurs.</narrative>
  </description>
